WEBVTT

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:27.170
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:33.950
Go! Shock!!

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:38.280
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:41.120
Friends who share the same future

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:43.820
With you guys

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:46.820
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:49.490
If we join forces

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:52.460
We’ll be invincible

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:55.800
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:58.040 --> 00:01:02.970
Delicious food gives life

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:09.110
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:11.180
Let’s eat!!

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:14.120
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:17.260
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:22.430
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:25.430
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:29.130
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:33.170
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:36.040
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:40.040
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:42.250
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:50.090
Someone once said...

00:01:50.660 --> 00:01:54.330
There are octopi that give off the 
scent of <i>matsutake</i> mushrooms...

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:57.830
Matsutactopi!

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:00.160
There are sweet

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:03.470
jellyfish like chestnuts...

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:07.140
Jellynuts!

00:02:08.840 --> 00:02:12.340
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:17.850
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:20.050 --> 00:02:21.990
It's a hard battle for the Four Kings

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:24.220
against the overwhelming 
strength of the Four-Beasts.

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:28.530
Meanwhile, Komatsu learns that it's 
not possible to prepare enough

00:02:28.530 --> 00:02:32.960
Medicinal Mochi to negate the 
Green Rain's poison for everyone.

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:36.070
If Medicinal Mochi is a Special 
Preparation Ingredient,

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:40.340
all we have to do is find 
a way to make it simple

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:43.640
for even an ordinary chef to make it!

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:46.180
The amount of time we can 
afford to give Chef Komatsu

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:51.080
is, as we thought, ten minutes. 
That's your time limit.

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:56.990
Save Humankind with Miraculous Gourmet Luck!

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:21.710
Alright,

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:25.620
I called together all the chefs 
in my chain of restaurants.

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:27.550
Then we're all set, right?

00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:31.060
We've all taken steps to 
gather our chef colleagues.

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:35.360
We can start mass production 
of the Medicinal Mochi anytime.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:41.200
Now we just need Chef Komatsu to 
find an easy way to make the mochi.

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:44.470
Komatsu-kun told us to leave it to him.

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:47.440
Let's have faith in him.

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:49.470
True,

00:03:49.470 --> 00:03:52.340
we got no choice but to 
trust him with the mochi.

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:55.380
Meanwhile, I'll do what I can do.

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:56.950
I'm counting on you, Tylan.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:58.680
Yeah, yeah.

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:03.620
Why doesn't Sensei seem to trust...

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:06.990
...that man?

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:12.060
Special Preparation 
Ingredient... Color Rice...

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:15.770
If I can't find a way to handle this rice,

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:18.040
we can't make Medicinal Mochi.

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:23.510
I only have...

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:25.540
...nine minutes left!

00:04:25.980 --> 00:04:27.610
I swear I'll succeed!

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:32.420
Toriko-san and the others are 
in a desperate battle too!

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:34.450
Jeez...

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:38.120
I didn't think this thing would 
throw all our skills back at us.

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:39.790
It's really getting on my nerves.

00:04:39.790 --> 00:04:42.860
The thing got the better of my Hair Punch.

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:44.730
I guess it really does...

00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:45.760
Yeah.

00:04:46.230 --> 00:04:48.670
...have a good grasp of our abilities.

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:51.300
The main body of the Four-Beasts

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:54.970
didn't just absorb the bodies 
of the four Beasts we fought.

00:04:54.970 --> 00:04:57.540
Apparently, it also absorbed 
their battle experience.

00:04:58.010 --> 00:05:00.580
Who gives a crap about that?

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:05.150
I'm gonna kick the ass of anything 
that acts cocky like that.

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:06.350
That's all.

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:08.650
Yeah, well...

00:05:08.650 --> 00:05:10.220
That's what we have to do.

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:39.280
The Medicinal Mochi can't be completed

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:42.120
unless the slightly different 
colored grains of rice are mixed

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:44.390
with just the right balance 
to make purple rice.

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:46.220
But...

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:49.390
...each individual grain is nonuniform

00:05:49.390 --> 00:05:52.230
and the colors quickly change 
with temperature and humidity.

00:05:53.030 --> 00:05:57.300
So the time it takes to steam the 
rice differs by seconds each time.

00:05:58.600 --> 00:05:59.600
The amount of pressure,

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:01.470
the number of times it's pounded,

00:06:01.470 --> 00:06:04.140
and the angle are different 
every single time.

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:05.840
It's too difficult.

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:09.610
I have to make the color balance, 
steaming, and pounding all uniform!

00:06:11.950 --> 00:06:13.850
As long as I can't find that rule,

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:17.320
it won't be mochi that everyone 
will be able to make.

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:21.090
At least not mochi that neutralizes 
the Green Rain's poison...

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:27.270
It's not working! And I'm 
almost out of Fragrance!

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:41.050
An emergency message from IGO?!

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:44.120
What?!

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:45.920
Mine didn't make any sound!

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:48.650
Well, that's because you 
don't have a cell phone.

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:50.820
That's right!

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:52.420
You guys got 'em?!

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:56.660
Pretty fancy!

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:00.670
This message is for everyone who's 
gotten wet from the Green Rain.

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:03.170
Tylan, the Poison Cuisine chef!

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:07.070
Those who have gotten 
wet from the Green Rain,

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:09.270
I'm only going to say this 
once, so listen closely.

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:13.340
The so-called Green Rain is highly poisonous.

00:07:13.340 --> 00:07:15.950
If it touches your body, 
you'll die within one hour.

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:18.980
We're drenched!

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:21.050
Don't worry!

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:23.620
It's just a false rumor!

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:27.230
They're broadcastin' a vicious rumor!

00:07:27.230 --> 00:07:29.290
A-Are you sure?

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:31.460
Yeah, positive!

00:07:31.460 --> 00:07:34.630
That guy's spoutin' nothin' but lies!

00:07:34.630 --> 00:07:37.640
You can tell he's a bad guy 
just by the way he looks!

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:39.300
Like you're one to talk with that face...

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:41.140
It's no lie!

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:44.410
Tylan is an expert in poison cuisine.

00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:48.350
And even though he's a chef from 
a non-member nation of IGO,

00:07:48.350 --> 00:07:50.750
he's in the top 30 of the World Chef Ranking.

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:52.280
He's a highly skilled chef.

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:55.550
And he knows a lot about poison.

00:07:55.550 --> 00:07:56.650
Aside from that,

00:07:56.650 --> 00:07:59.320
he's famous for never appearing in public,

00:07:59.320 --> 00:08:01.330
so for him to do this...

00:08:03.630 --> 00:08:04.860
There's no mistake.

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:07.330
It's true.

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:09.730
You'll all die shortly.

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:12.840
What?!

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:14.810
But don't worry.

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:18.010
I'll tell you how to slow down 
the effect of the poison.

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:20.510
If you push the right pressure points,

00:08:20.510 --> 00:08:22.750
you'll extend your life for 
a short period of time.

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:24.650
You need to massage these points 
for a total of five minutes,

00:08:25.180 --> 00:08:27.690
but it's very complicated, so 
focus and follow my directions.

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:29.920
The video will be looped over and over.

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:33.120
Pass it on to those who 
aren't watching this too.

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:35.430
Alright, here I go. First...

00:08:35.430 --> 00:08:37.700
Wait! Wait a second!

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:39.200
You're goin' too fast!

00:08:41.130 --> 00:08:42.270
Unlisted

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:44.940
Hello?

00:08:46.470 --> 00:08:47.340
You're...

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:53.610
He only has

00:08:53.610 --> 00:08:55.150
eight and a half minutes left.

00:08:55.150 --> 00:08:57.020
Meal King Yuda...

00:08:57.020 --> 00:09:00.320
You've been quiet. But what do you think?

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:04.460
An estimated 500 million people 
have been exposed to the rain.

00:09:04.460 --> 00:09:09.130
Even if we make the mochi now, the 
very most we can do is 50 million.

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:12.060
As someone who always does medicinal cooking,

00:09:12.060 --> 00:09:13.500
to be honest,

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:18.170
it's close to impossible to simplify 
the cooking of Medicinal Mochi.

00:09:18.170 --> 00:09:21.510
My apologies to Setsuno-sama, 
who has faith in him, though.

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:24.980
Oh dear, that's quite a 
faint-hearted statement.

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:29.150
You shouldn't underestimate 
Koma-chan's talent.

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:31.520
Livebearer-san is right.

00:09:31.950 --> 00:09:34.220
Now that Komatsu-san has 
acquired Honoring the Food,

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:37.660
it would be appropriate to say that 
his talent has come into bloom.

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:41.360
Just the other day, Komatsu-san and I 
attempted to cook with Bubble Fruit.

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:45.400
Vanishing Japanese Cuisine

00:09:43.090 --> 00:09:45.930
We finally succeeded!

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:47.630
Wonderful!

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:49.430
It's just too bad...

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:52.900
Even though it's the amazing Bubble Fruit,

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:56.740
you can only eat it by 
mastering Honoring the Food.

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:58.380
That's true, but...

00:09:58.380 --> 00:10:02.380
Chiru-san, I've been thinking 
that maybe the food

00:10:02.380 --> 00:10:05.720
of Vanishing Japanese Cuisine 
should be easier to eat.

00:10:06.650 --> 00:10:12.020
But the dishes that we serve 
use delicate ingredients.

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:16.230
I believe it would be difficult to make 
it easy for all customers to eat them.

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:18.330
Can I borrow a Million Tomato?

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:24.000
And so Komatsu-san began to 
prepare a Million Tomato.

00:10:29.970 --> 00:10:32.310
But in a matter of moments, he was done.

00:10:34.310 --> 00:10:40.620
He found a new preparation method for a 
delicate dish that anyone could enjoy.

00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:42.320
Wow!

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:46.190
I felt envious despite myself.

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:50.360
Envious of Komatsu-san's 
extraordinary gifts as a chef,

00:10:50.360 --> 00:10:54.670
but especially of the way 
ingredients accept him.

00:10:59.240 --> 00:11:02.070
Maybe all of us

00:11:02.070 --> 00:11:06.180
are in the presence of a remarkable person.

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:08.150
Right, Nono?

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:12.520
I see.

00:11:13.120 --> 00:11:14.420
Nono...

00:11:18.290 --> 00:11:20.460
Watch him.

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:25.830
Then take each other's 
hands and break into a run.

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:28.800
For you two are the next generation...

00:11:32.240 --> 00:11:34.040
Amazing...

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:35.510
That's...

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:07.240
As expected, that thing's one tough mother!

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:30.030
It sent the impact of the attack 
outside of its body again!

00:12:31.300 --> 00:12:32.130
Toriko!

00:12:37.470 --> 00:12:39.300
Toriko, are you okay?!

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:41.740
Yeah. But...

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:47.850
...that was my last Spiked Punch.

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:54.390
I'm out of strength...

00:12:56.090 --> 00:12:58.260
If I don't get somethin' to eat,

00:12:58.260 --> 00:13:00.590
I'm gonna lose my voice.

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:08.070
Bastard, actin' high and mighty 
with that huge voice...

00:13:17.840 --> 00:13:19.010
Time left...

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:21.450
One minute and counting.

00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:22.350
Komatsu-san...

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:30.190
This rain is really 
damaging my hair cuticles.

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:36.930
We'd better settle this fast.

00:13:36.930 --> 00:13:39.400
The rain is wearing us down too.

00:13:57.780 --> 00:14:00.350
He doesn't notice that I'm here.

00:14:00.350 --> 00:14:02.490
What amazing concentration.

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:03.890
Time left...

00:14:03.890 --> 00:14:05.160
Ten seconds.

00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:08.460
So he couldn't do it...

00:14:08.690 --> 00:14:10.900
We can't fault him for trying.

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:16.030
Everyone, please start 
making the Medicinal Mochi.

00:14:16.030 --> 00:14:19.100
Unfortunately, we'll have to decide 
who's going to be able to eat it.

00:14:52.140 --> 00:14:54.570
I did it!

00:14:57.310 --> 00:15:00.110
I-I found a simple way to make

00:15:00.110 --> 00:15:01.910
Medicinal Mochi!

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:04.450
Chef Komatsu!

00:15:06.850 --> 00:15:09.150
You did it in exactly ten minutes?

00:15:09.520 --> 00:15:10.720
Alright!

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:13.590
Pass the cooking method on 
to the chefs of the world!

00:15:14.130 --> 00:15:16.730
We'll have you connected to everywhere!

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:19.230
It's all set up!

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:24.570
50,000 chefs from Dhamala's group!

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:26.570
Follow Chef Komatsu's instructions

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:28.840
to make Medicinal Mochi!

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:30.140
Yes, sir!

00:15:30.140 --> 00:15:33.140
I-I'm going to teach 50,000 chefs?

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:35.480
No, not only them.

00:15:37.720 --> 00:15:38.680
Chef Lulubu too

00:15:39.150 --> 00:15:41.650
has 20,000 chefs working 
exclusively for his Guts group.

00:15:41.650 --> 00:15:43.720
T-Twenty-thousand...

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:48.190
Chef Sumire has gathered 10,000 chefs 
from all of the cooking schools.

00:15:50.190 --> 00:15:52.630
Meal King Yuda has gathered 40,000 chefs.

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:56.030
I called on everyone and 
not one millimeter less.

00:15:56.730 --> 00:15:59.840
Mama Tsurara has gathered 8,000 
of her snack bar colleagues.

00:15:59.840 --> 00:16:02.070
Wonderful!

00:16:02.070 --> 00:16:07.210
I've gathered 30,000 of my former 
Underground Cooking World cronies.

00:16:07.210 --> 00:16:11.550
And I brought together 100,000 
people from my group.

00:16:12.020 --> 00:16:14.220
O-One hundred-thousand?!

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:15.290
And also...

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:16.620
We're ready too!

00:16:16.890 --> 00:16:18.420
Chef Komatsu!

00:16:18.720 --> 00:16:20.930
Everyone from Hotel Gourmet!

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:28.970
And there are many other chefs 
gathered all over the world too.

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:34.540
There must be a total of five million people.

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:36.140
That many...

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:38.110
That many people came together for this...

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:41.950
Do we have enough ingredients?!

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:43.380
Leave it to us!

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:44.680
Tom-san!

00:16:44.680 --> 00:16:49.250
All of us merchants will deliver the 
ingredients we gathered together!

00:16:49.250 --> 00:16:52.020
Word's already spreading! 
The rest is up to you guys!

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:53.620
Right!

00:16:54.830 --> 00:16:56.730
Thank you!

00:16:56.730 --> 00:16:58.130
Save the thanks for later.

00:16:58.960 --> 00:17:01.470
Right now, give everyone 
your cooking lecture.

00:17:02.030 --> 00:17:06.070
You're broadcasting to 
over five million chefs.

00:17:06.070 --> 00:17:08.640
Get cooperation from the civilians too.

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:10.480
I never imagined Johannes

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:13.340
would call me to ask for help broadcasting.

00:17:15.350 --> 00:17:17.680
We're counting on you, Komatsu-kun!

00:17:18.280 --> 00:17:20.220
Everyone, are you ready?

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:24.790
Then I'll give you a lecture 
on making Medicinal Mochi.

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:28.560
Medicinal Mochi has to be 
an exquisite purple color.

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:32.960
Then you use Mouthwatering 
Water and Deliciousalt.

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:36.870
Put 100 grams of Deliciousalt into 
one liter of Mouthwatering Water

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:38.000
and mix well.

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:40.870
Water and salt you can get anywhere...

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:44.040
Immerse the Color Rice in it for 25 seconds.

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:45.410
Could this really be how he's...

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:48.050
...preserving the color!

00:17:48.050 --> 00:17:52.780
Like how exposing apples to salt water 
will maintain the color... color fixing!

00:17:52.780 --> 00:17:55.420
It's a basic cooking technique.

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:57.890
But with the sensitive Color Rice,

00:17:57.890 --> 00:18:00.930
won't it absorb the salt water and change?

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:01.890
No.

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:05.400
The Color Rice breathes and is alive.

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:09.530
Fresh water is one thing, but 
it doesn't absorb salt water.

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:14.040
Putting the rice in salt water 
doesn't just preserve the color.

00:18:14.340 --> 00:18:17.310
It also separates the 
colors of the Color Rice.

00:18:17.980 --> 00:18:20.610
It's difficult to distinguish 
the grains of rice by colors,

00:18:20.610 --> 00:18:22.780
but it's simple to tell them apart by weight.

00:18:23.110 --> 00:18:25.220
Tell them apart by weight?

00:18:27.590 --> 00:18:29.720
When I touched the Color Rice,

00:18:29.720 --> 00:18:32.920
somehow I knew that each grain

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:34.630
had a different weight.

00:18:34.890 --> 00:18:36.060
The voice...

00:18:36.060 --> 00:18:39.660
You could hear the voice of 
the ingredients, Komatsu-san.

00:18:39.900 --> 00:18:45.700
Use the Color Rice floating on the very 
top and the rice on the very bottom.

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:50.010
Get a 1:1 proportion of rice with 
dark color and rice with light color

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:52.010
and then steam it.

00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:55.750
Color Rice absorbs a lot of water,

00:18:55.750 --> 00:18:58.350
so it doesn't take much 
time at all to steam it.

00:18:58.350 --> 00:18:59.750
30 seconds is fine.

00:19:00.590 --> 00:19:02.820
After that, you take the steamed Color Rice

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:05.160
and pound and knead it.

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:07.890
The color is set, so it won't change.

00:19:07.890 --> 00:19:11.300
You don't need to worry about the number 
of times to pound it or from what angle.

00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:14.430
At this point, for every five liters of rice,

00:19:14.430 --> 00:19:16.470
put in 290 grams

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:18.170
of perfectly sweet

00:19:18.170 --> 00:19:20.510
plump chestnut paste.

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:24.710
After that, just do this to 
get them in a ball shape.

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:26.980
That's...

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:32.120
...the color of Medicine Mochi, 
and not even a millimeter off!

00:19:33.320 --> 00:19:35.650
He's a genius...

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:37.560
Three minutes!

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:39.620
It took him three minutes to make it!

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:41.890
You took a Special Preparation Ingredient

00:19:41.890 --> 00:19:46.760
and turned it into a quick 
dish like instant ramen.

00:19:47.100 --> 00:19:50.170
Alright! Begin cooking now!

00:19:51.600 --> 00:19:53.200
As soon as it's finished, distribute it!

00:19:53.810 --> 00:19:57.540
With five million chefs, 200 
million can be made in two hours!

00:19:57.540 --> 00:19:59.380
With this cooking method,

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:02.850
I bet those of us here can 
make the rest we need!

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:05.720
Brilliant, Komatsu-kun!

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:09.750
And to think, you accomplished 
it in ten minutes!

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:12.090
It wasn't ten minutes, Sensei.

00:20:12.760 --> 00:20:16.260
He discovered the cooking 
method after five minutes.

00:20:16.260 --> 00:20:21.600
Chef Komatsu used the last five figuring 
out how to make the mochi more delicious.

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:23.200
What?!

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:26.840
So that's what the chestnut paste is for!

00:20:27.670 --> 00:20:31.180
If people are going to eat them, I 
figured it's better if they're tasty.

00:20:31.180 --> 00:20:33.380
Chestnuts are used in 
medicinal cooking anyway.

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:36.010
They're a perfect match for Medicinal Mochi.

00:20:36.010 --> 00:20:37.780
You're something else!

00:20:37.780 --> 00:20:40.150
Even at a time like that, 
you focused on flavor!

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:44.220
Toriko-san! Coco-san! Sunny-san! Zebra-san!

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:46.690
I think we're going to get through this here!

00:20:46.690 --> 00:20:50.160
You guys please take care of the Four-Beasts!

00:21:09.650 --> 00:21:15.620
I have been alone

00:21:16.820 --> 00:21:23.160
Ever since that day

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:30.570
All I got was a definite history

00:21:30.770 --> 00:21:37.240
But tomorrow is still, still, 
still just an uncertain dream

00:21:37.240 --> 00:21:40.810
It’s like a tautology, logy

00:21:41.010 --> 00:21:44.080
This is a tautology, logy

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:48.150
A dream is still a dream

00:21:48.250 --> 00:21:51.520
Not gonna wake up, logy, logy

00:21:51.690 --> 00:21:55.990
Right now, we’re lookin’ at

00:21:56.060 --> 00:21:59.730
What it is we're lookin' at

00:21:59.730 --> 00:22:07.640
The thing we’re lookin’ 
at ain’t no illusion

00:22:10.040 --> 00:22:13.040
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:13.410 --> 00:22:17.220
Yun is hiding somewhere in the image 
you're about to see, so please find him!

00:22:17.220 --> 00:22:23.520
Hiding Level 24

00:22:17.680 --> 00:22:20.080
Today, Yun's Hiding Level is 24!

00:22:20.080 --> 00:22:21.850
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds.

00:22:21.850 --> 00:22:23.820
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:24.820 --> 00:22:26.490
Now there's a mountain in the midst of fall!

00:22:26.490 --> 00:22:28.990
The baked sweet potatoes look delicious!

00:22:28.990 --> 00:22:31.400
But where's Yun?

00:22:33.530 --> 00:22:35.930
Yun is... right here!

00:22:39.970 --> 00:22:41.910
He was hiding in the fallen leaves!

00:22:41.910 --> 00:22:43.340
Did all of you notice him?

00:22:43.880 --> 00:22:46.740
At last, the battle with the 
Four-Beasts is in the final stages!

00:22:46.740 --> 00:22:49.780
If you don't watch it next 
time, what will you watch?!

00:22:52.270 --> 00:22:53.460
It's time for the last resort!

00:22:53.460 --> 00:22:55.680
The Four Kings' ultimate technique!

00:22:55.680 --> 00:22:58.940
This is the only thing left that can beat the Four-Beasts!

00:22:58.940 --> 00:23:02.720
Burst! Curiosity about the Flavor! The Four Kings' Combined Skill!

00:23:03.060 --> 00:23:05.110
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
